 "name_zh": "位于施瓦本侏罗山的冰河时期最古老的艺术洞穴",
 "name_zh_source": "wikidata",
 "name_en": "Caves and Ice Age Art in the Swabian Jura",
 "name_local": "Höhlen und Eiszeitkunst der Schwäbischen Alb",
 "local_lang": "de",
